o AGI","titleZh":"Yann LeCun：开源 AI 与专有系统、大语言模型的局限以及通往 AGI 之路 · 杨立昆 — Lex Fridman 播客","published":"2024-03-07T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1709769600000,"link":"https://aipodcast.jasonlin.tech/#/episode/lecun-lexfridm","summary":"Yann LeCun discusses the dangers of proprietary AI concentration, the limitations of auto-regressive LLMs, and why open source AI is crucial for a good future.","summaryZh":"Yann LeCun 讨论了专有 AI 集中的危险、自回归大语言模型的局限性，以及为什么开源 AI 对美好未来至关重要。"},{"id":"lecun-lexfridm-2022","sourceId":"lecun","sourceName":"杨立昆","title":"Self-Supervised Learning: The Dark Matter of Intelligence","titleZh":"自监督学习：智能的暗物质 · 杨立昆 — Lex Fridman 播客","published":"2022-01-22T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1642809600000,"link":"https://aipodcast.jasonlin.tech/#/episode/lecun-lexfridm-2022","summary":"Yann LeCun explains self-supervised learning as a way for machines to learn background knowledge from observation, like humans do, and why it's crucial for efficient learning.","summaryZh":"杨立昆解释自监督学习是一种让机器像人类一样通过观察学习背景知识的方法，并说明其对高效学习的重要性。"},{"id":"lecun-lexfridm-2019","sourceId":"lecun","sourceName":"杨立昆","title":"Yann LeCun on AI Alignment and the Lessons from 2001: A Space Odyssey","titleZh":"杨立昆谈 AI 对齐与《2001 太空漫游》的启示 · 杨立昆 — Lex Fridman 播客","published":"2019-08-31T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1567209600000,"link":"https://aipodcast.jasonlin.tech/#/episode/lecun-lexfridm-2019","summary":"Yann LeCun discusses AI value alignment, using HAL 9000 from 2001: A Space Odyssey as an example of misaligned objectives, and compares designing AI objective functions to human legal systems.","summaryZh":"杨立昆以《2001 太空漫游》中的 HAL 9000 为例，探讨 AI 价值对齐问题，指出目标函数设计不当会导致灾难，并将 AI 目标函数设计类比于人类法律体系。"}]}